{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46400","headline":"寄上荆渚因梦庐岳乃图壁赋诗 · 齐己","name":"寄上荆渚因梦庐岳乃图壁赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦绕嵯峨里，神疎骨亦寒。\n觉来谁共说，壁上自图看。\n古翠松藏寺，春红杏湿坛。\n归心几时遂，日向渐衰残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}